  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_1328.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(56 fotos)La noche de este viernes ha abierto sus puertas en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda (antiguo D&eacute;cada) el pub Flamenkito. Para el evento ha habido actuaci&oacute;n en directo de Juan Ram&oacute;n y sus Amigos, con tres pases, complementados por la m&uacute;sica flamenquita por excelencia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1313.jpg\" alt=\"img_1313\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1315.jpg\" alt=\"img_1315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1317.jpg\" alt=\"img_1317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1318.jpg\" alt=\"img_1318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1321.jpg\" alt=\"img_1321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1323.jpg\" alt=\"img_1323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1325.jpg\" alt=\"img_1325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1328.jpg\" alt=\"img_1328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugflamenkito/img_1329.jpg\" alt=\"img_1329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev